[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0745","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0745.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21286","title":"Microsoft Windows 电话服务远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows Telephony Service（电话服务）存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122），攻击者可通过构造特制的RPC请求触发该漏洞，在目标系统上以SYSTEM权限执行任意代码。利用该漏洞需要用户交互（如访问恶意共享或接收特制电话请求），影响Windows 10/11及Windows Server多个版本。CVSS评分8.8，危害等级高危。Microsoft已在2025年1月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21286"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:49Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:59Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新，对应补丁 KB5049981（Windows Server 2022）、KB5049983（Windows 11 23H2）、KB5049984（Windows 10 22H2）、KB5050004（Windows Server 2025）或 KB5050021（Windows 11 24H2）。可通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制外部访问 TAPI 服务端口并禁用不必要的电话服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21286","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21286.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21286.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21286.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21286.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21286.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21286.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/13ed3f592a10631c0caaa49cbae4f7b3f5d02049/2025/CVE-2025-21286.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21286","https://github.com/cristianovisk/cves_data_intelligence/blob/d992222e16f6aa9a574abfb992cc213eb683eda6/social_