dows Server 2025 升级至 10.0.26100.2894。如无法立即打补丁，可限制低权限用户登录受影响的系统，并监控 COM 组件异常调用行为作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21281","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21281.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21281.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21281.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21281.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21281.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21281.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/da1453d4cae0dea874922584911158e4da10a575/2025/CVE-2025-21281.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21281","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21281.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21281.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0740.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0739","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0739.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21280","title":"Microsoft Windows 虚拟受信任的平台模块拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows 虚拟受信任的平台模块（Virtual TPM）存在输入验证不当漏洞（CWE-20）。具有低权限的本地攻击者可利用该漏洞向 vTPM 组件发送特制输入，导致目标系统的虚拟 TPM 服务拒绝响应或崩溃，从而影响依赖 TPM 功能的安全特性（如 BitLocker、Windows Hello 等）的正常运行。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，但需要攻击者已获得本地访问权限。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21280"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:58Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5049981)，涵盖 Windows 10/11 及 Server 2016/2019/2022/2025 全系列受影响版本。可通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制本地用户对 vTPM 设备的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21280","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21280.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21280.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21280.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21280.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21280.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21280.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a8d9b19e8bcb98a5a7dedc851836a009f19fbc3e/2025/CVE-2025-21280.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21280.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21280","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21280.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0739.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0737","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0737.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21278","title":"Microsoft Windows 远程桌面网关（RD Gateway）拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows 远程桌面网关（RD Gateway）存在竞争条件漏洞（CWE-362），由于在处理并发请求时未正确同步资源访问，导致本地攻击者可利用竞态条件触发系统资源耗尽或服务崩溃。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2019/2022 等版本，CVSS 评分 6.2，危害等级中危。攻击者无需任何权限或用户交互即可利用此漏洞，但需具备本地系统访问能力，成功利用可导致目标系统拒绝服务。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21278"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:58Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新：Windows 10/11 用户通过 Windows Update 自动更新至对应修复版本（如 22H2 需升级至 10.0.19045.5371 以上），Windows Server 用户安装 KB5050004 月度汇总。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙中限制 RD Gateway 服务（端口 443/3391）的本地访问来源，仅允许受信任管理 IP 连接，并禁用不必要的远程桌面网关角色以缩小攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21278","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21278.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21278.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21278.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21278.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21278.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21278.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a8d9b19e8bcb98a5a7dedc851836a009f19fbc3e/2025/CVE-2025-21278.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21278","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21278.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21278.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0737.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0736","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0736.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21277","title":"Microsoft MSMQ 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft 消息队列服务（MSMQ）存在拒绝服务漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可向运行 MSMQ 服务的目标系统发送特制消息，触发服务异常并导致其停止响应，造成消息处理中断。该漏洞影响启用了 MSMQ 的 Windows 系统，攻击者无需任何权限或用户交互即可在网络层面发起利用，仅对系统可用性造成危害。攻击成功后将导致消息队列服务不可用，影响依赖消息队列通信的业务流程。Microsoft 已通过安全更新修复该漏洞，建议受影响系统尽快安装补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21277"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:58Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新，各受影响版本对应的累积更新 KB 号如下：Windows 10 21H2/22H2 安装 KB5049985；Windows 11 22H2/23H2/24H2 安装 KB5049993/KB5049987/KB5050888；Windows Server 2019/2022/2025 安装对应 KB5041050/KB5049989/KB5050889。可将系统自动更新配置为\"自动下载并安装\"，或通过 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载对应架构（x64/arm64）的累积更新包进行安装。如暂时无法立即安装补丁，可在防火墙层阻断 MSMQ 服务（TCP 端口 1801）及 RPC 相关端口的入站访问作为临时缓解措施，待维护窗口期再完成补丁部署。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21277","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21277.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21277.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21277.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21277.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21277.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21277.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a5f32c7015b5096d8cfd855ae981350d42219587/2025/CVE-2025-21277.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21277","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21277.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21277"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0736.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0735","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0735.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21276","title":"Microsoft Windows MapUrlToZone 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows MapUrlToZone 组件存在整数下溢（CWE-191）导致的拒绝服务漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者无需用户交互即可向目标系统发送特制请求，触发 MapUrlToZone 函数在处理 URL 映射时发生整数下溢，导致目标系统服务崩溃或停止响应。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21276"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:58Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5050061），可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。受影响版本包括：Windows 10（需升级至 10.0.10240.20890/14393.7699/17763.6775/19044.5371/19045.5371 及以上）、Windows 11（需升级至 22621.4751/22631.4751/26100.2894 及以上）、Windows Server（需升级至 14393.7699/17763.6775/20348.3091/26100.2894 及以上）。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制不可信来源对 MapUrlToZone 组件的网络访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21276","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21276.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21276.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/b