ty/CVE-2025-21275","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21275.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2e0e3782ab192a0dba6edbe5e9deeb3c79e8414c/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21275.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21275.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21275.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21275.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21275.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21275.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/51172ac815e3679269b063a6e72648b897f17276/2025/CVE-2025-21275.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/7bec7ab13a920b5bdca1b43ac1859f030aec77a0/api/2025/CVE-2025-21275.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/mitre/CVE-2025-21275"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0734.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0733","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0733.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21274","title":"Microsoft Windows 事件跟踪拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows 事件跟踪（Event Tracing）组件存在安全漏洞，由于对路径名链接的不当解析（CWE-59），具有低权限的本地攻击者可利用该漏洞触发系统拒绝服务。攻击者需先获得本地访问权限，通过创建特制符号链接等方式操纵事件跟踪会话，导致目标系统服务崩溃或停止响应。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 各版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21274"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:57Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 KB5049981，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。如无法立即安装补丁，可限制本地用户对事件跟踪组件的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21274","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21274.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2e0e3782ab192a0dba6edbe5e9deeb3c79e8414c/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21274.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21274.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21274.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21274.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21274.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/51172ac815e3679269b063a6e72648b897f17276/2025/CVE-2025-21274.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21274.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21274","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21274.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0733.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0732","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0732.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21273","title":"Microsoft Windows 电话服务远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows Telephony Service（TAPI）存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122），远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制请求触发该漏洞，在目标系统上以服务权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危。利用该漏洞需要用户交互（如点击恶意链接或打开恶意文件），攻击复杂度低且无需身份认证。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21273"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:57Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新：Windows Server 2025 安装 KB5050009，Windows Server 23H2 安装 KB5049984，Windows Server 2022 安装 KB5049983，Windows 11 安装 KB5050021，Windows 10 安装 KB5049981。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取，或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，建议在防火墙层面限制对 TAPI 服务的远程访问，并禁用不必要的电话服务（TapiSrv）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21273"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0732.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0731","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0731.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21272","title":"Microsoft Windows COM 服务器信息泄露漏洞","description":"Windows COM 服务器组件存在未初始化内存信息泄露漏洞（CWE-908）。由于 COM 服务器在处理特定调用时未能正确初始化内存区域，导致未初始化的内存内容可能被泄露。已获得低权限的本地攻击者可通过向受影响系统发送特制的 COM 调用请求触发该漏洞，从而读取本不应被访问的敏感内存数据，造成机密信息泄露。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21272"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:46Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:57Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 KB5050061。该更新适用于 Windows Server 2008 SP2，需先安装服务栈更新 KB5050682 后再安装此安全更新。可通过 Microsoft Update Catalog 下载独立安装包，或通过 WSUS 同步推送。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制本地用户对 COM 服务器的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21272","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21272.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2e0e3782ab192a0dba6edbe5e9deeb3c79e8414c/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21272.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7b