7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21271.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2e0e3782ab192a0dba6edbe5e9deeb3c79e8414c/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21271.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21271.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21271.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21271.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21271.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21271.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/51172ac815e3679269b063a6e72648b897f17276/2025/CVE-2025-21271.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/7bec7ab13a920b5bdca1b43ac1859f030aec77a0/api/2025/CVE-2025-21271.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21271"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0730.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0729","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0729.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21270","title":"Microsoft 消息队列 (MSMQ) 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft 消息队列（MSMQ）服务存在资源消耗漏洞，该漏洞源于对特制消息请求的处理不当，导致系统资源被过度消耗。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过网络向目标系统的 MSMQ 服务发送精心构造的数据包，触发资源耗尽条件，导致 MSMQ 服务停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21270"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:46Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:57Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5050061)，通过 Windows Update 或 WSUS 自动获取。各版本对应修复版本号：Windows 10/11 需升级至 10.0.10240.20890/19044.5371/22621.4751/26100.2894 等；Windows Server 需升级至 10.0.17763.6775/20348.3091/26100.2894 等。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙中阻止入站 MSMQ 流量（TCP 端口 1801）作为临时缓解措施，或禁用 Message Queuing 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21270","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21270.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2e0e3782ab192a0dba6edbe5e9deeb3c79e8414c/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21270.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21270.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21270.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21270.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21270.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/eaba6ba6891dae2972376e68ae56a38b641030d7/2025/CVE-2025-21270.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21270","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21270.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21270"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0729.toml"}]